  toasts with undo, modals, drawers, skeletons, confirm dialogs
- Layout: grouped sidebar, breadcrumbs, notifications bell, quick actions,
  mobile drawer, page transitions
- A11y + code quality: eslint clean across app/, tsc clean for all admin
  code, SSR-render-tested routes

